## Autonomy

<!-- Controls how exec-* commands write here. Options per row: act-and-tell | propose-and-wait -->

| Write type | Mode |
|---|---|
| Evidence entries, LOG lines, people touchpoints, meeting files, reviews | act-and-tell |
| Factual ledger rows in models/ (scope change log, most recent sponsorship act, visibility rows) | act-and-tell |
| Ledger snapshots and ratings (scope snapshot, sponsorship level, readiness rating) | propose-and-wait |
| Hypotheses in models/ (new, or confidence/status changes) | propose-and-wait |
| Anything in self/ | propose-and-wait |
| Commitments (max 3 active; a new one proposes which to close) | propose-and-wait |

## Review cadence

- Weekly review: {{WEEKLY_REVIEW_DAY}}
- Monthly review: first week of each month
- Retrospective: every 6 months, and after any promotion, reorg, or role change

## Privacy

This Brain holds hypotheses about named people and about the owner's standing. It is private.

- Keep it out of any shared repository, shared drive, or team workspace.
- If it is a git repo, it has no remote, or a private remote only the owner can access.
- exec-* skills never copy its contents into Product Brains, tickets, shared docs, or messages.

